  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "11c27067",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Brands <br>\n",
    "We decided to do \"manual\" brand mapping because it gives the biggest controll factor while the number of values is managable. \n",
<<<<<<< HEAD
    "Also with some of the brand names beeing very short (e.g. vw) fuzzy algorithms would perform with reduced accuracy"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 95,
   "id": "e1a997fa",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "brand_mapping = {\n",
    "    \"vw\": \"vw\",\n",
    "    \"v\": \"vw\",\n",
    "    \"w\": \"vw\",\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \"toyota\": \"toyota\",\n",
    "    \"toyot\": \"toyota\",\n",
    "    \"oyota\": \"toyota\",\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \"audi\": \"audi\",\n",
    "    \"aud\": \"audi\",\n",
    "    \"udi\": \"audi\",\n",
    "    \"ud\": \"audi\",\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \"ford\": \"ford\",\n",
    "    \"for\": \"ford\",\n",
    "    \"ord\": \"ford\",\n",
    "    \"or\": \"ford\",\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \"bmw\": \"bmw\",\n",
    "    \"bm\": \"bmw\",\n",
    "    \"mw\": \"bmw\",\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \"skoda\": \"skoda\",\n",
    "    \"skod\": \"skoda\",\n",
    "    \"koda\": \"skoda\",\n",
    "    \"kod\": \"skoda\",\n",
    "    \n",
    "    \"opel\": \"opel\",\n",
    "    \"ope\": \"opel\",\n",
    "    \"pel\": \"opel\",\n",
