       "</style><body><div id=\"sk-container-id-12\" class=\"sk-top-container\"><div class=\"sk-text-repr-fallback\"><pre>Pipeline(steps=[(&#x27;preprocessor&#x27;,\n",
       "                 ColumnTransformer(transformers=[(&#x27;num&#x27;, RobustScaler(),\n",
       "                                                  [&#x27;year&#x27;, &#x27;mileage&#x27;, &#x27;tax&#x27;,\n",
